  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>With WinTAK installed, open it for the first time and connect it to your unit's TAK server by importing the Client Package you downloaded.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open WinTAK",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the <strong>WinTAK</strong> application from the desktop.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/79a6bb8767bf3d58.webp",
              "width": 88,
              "height": 114
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept the EULA",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>After a moment the <strong>Device Setup Wizard</strong> opens. Its first step is to accept the <strong>EULA</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8e12e26181a305e0.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 318
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Import your Client Package",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The wizard asks whether to import a data package — this is your <strong>Client Package</strong> (<code>Name.zip</code>) downloaded from this app's front page. Select <strong>Yes</strong> and point to the Client Package in your downloads.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2d5fea49b6aeb184.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 198
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose an import strategy",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>After you choose the package and press <strong>Open</strong>, the <strong>Select Import Strategy</strong> window opens.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ce16efd0433fc825.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 270
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select UserPreferenceImportStrategy",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Select <strong>UserPreferenceImportStrategy</strong> and press <strong>OK</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/69ab4f1ee687b607.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 270
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose a map base",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The package may include several <strong>map bases</strong>. Choose your preferred one — you can change it later.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dd8073840bd5be9a.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 156
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set your callsign",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The wizard asks whether to define your callsign. Select <strong>Yes</strong> and enter your <strong>assigned callsign</strong>. It then asks for additional WMS (map) service sources.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b3cd94ffd6dc7a08.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 206
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Skip extra WMS sources",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Extra WMS sources are not needed — clear the boxes and press <strong>OK</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9e147b44d330b7ba.webp",
              "width": 428,
              "height": 276
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
